# Application API

Create an application-owned endpoint such as:

```text
GET /.netlify/functions/economic-series?slug=real-gdp-growth
```

or:

```text
GET /api/economic-series/real-gdp-growth
```

The endpoint must return the normalized series and observations.

The client response should include enough metadata to display:

- Chart title
- Question answered by the chart
- Units
- Frequency
- Seasonal-adjustment status
- Transformation
- Latest observation date
- Last successful fetch time
- Source name
- Source URL
- Observations

Return consistent error responses.

Example:

```ts
interface ApiError {
  error: {
    code: string;
    message: string;
  };
}
```

Do not expose API keys, raw database credentials, or unnecessary provider internals.

