# Data Freshness

Create a reusable freshness utility.

The UI must distinguish among:

- Current
- Possibly stale
- Refresh failed, cached data shown
- No data available

Freshness must be evaluated relative to the series frequency, not by a single global threshold.

For quarterly GDP data, the application must not label data stale merely because it is several weeks old.

Document the initial freshness rules. They may be approximate in this epic, but they must be explicit and testable.

